<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\駅ホーム.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\元木駅.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "古郡なつみ画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "新村春花画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "五島絵梨奈画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Senpai, are you both really going away...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, can't be helped, right? After what our parents did, it's hard to stay in this town. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, there's no home or family left for us here anyway."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">You too, Kogori-senpai</STYLE>... I'm going to be lonely."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'll come back. My grandma's house is an hour away by train, so we can see each other anytime."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> looked down, her shoulders trembling.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">It had been settled that I and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> would leave Motoki-cho.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">For us, the children of a suspect and a victim, there were too many curious eyes to live in Motoki-cho.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What's with you, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">! At least see us off with a smile at the end!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Please don't say it's the end!<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE>The end... I don't want that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hahaha! Well, I'll come visit, maybe this summer break, so get ready to welcome me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
Primavera..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"The Primavera deluxe set! If you won't treat me to one over summer break, you're not welcome!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A-are you stupid!? How much do you think that thing costs!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Besides, I swore with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> we wouldn't go there till we're grown up! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Right!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm, that's true, but if you're treating, I think I'd like to go too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"It's settled!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Settled, nothing! Even </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s turning on me! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Damn... I gotta save up my allowance before summer break..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh? Is this seriously turning into you treating me? I was 100% joking..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're really soft about this kind of thing..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahh! What a relief to get away from a hyena of a </STYLE>junior<STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">best friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, so you'd say something like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I was j-j-j-joking!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But, <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, you're going so far away..."<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, where was it you're moving to again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm gonna be taken in by the Niimura main family. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's kinda far, and out in the country, though. I'll get in touch!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Let's see each other again!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah! Of course, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">best friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> held each other tight.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Whoa, sorry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I mean, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, your elbow was dislocated, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, that's fine now! See, all better, all better!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And this time I was the one who threw my arms around </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"We'll always, always... be friends..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Waaah! I'm going to be lonely after all!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> finally burst into tears.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Next time we meet, will </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> be cured of being a shrimp?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I was still holding a bit of a grudge over what she'd said during the sushi.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Sniff... My height is not a disease! This is exactly what makes me Erina Goto! 
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, it's because you're built just the way you look that you're <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> grinned, still crying.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, you're still saying that? Shall we have sushi together again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Eek...! <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, you're scary..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Little </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3">'s body shrank even further.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"But honestly, <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, when you shoved the table at my house, that scared me most of all..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I've apologized for that so many times... I was really scared back then too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, you had a look in your eyes like, 'Isn't Gotooo hiding something?' It was scary... 
{PAUSE ""}
I really didn't know anything back then!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What? Even a </STYLE>genius girl<STYLE ID="1"> couldn't figure it out from that, huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"With nothing but the information <STYLE ID="4">Ojisan</STYLE> gave me, there's no way... Even being told about a shinigami, it doesn't click."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahahaha! Well, if it was gonna turn out like that, I should've explained it to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> from the start."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that's not right... In the first place, it was me who... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s dad..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, did you forget your promise to me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah... sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">After that incident, I and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> made just one promise.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It all began with an accident: I let a balloon fly away, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s dad died.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Again and again I told </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> I was </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="わ">sorry</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> for it, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">"If you want me to forgive you, don't ever apologize again!"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was all she said.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> doesn't resent me at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I was able to believe that.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Of course, part of the reason I could believe it was that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is my best friend, but there were also </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s words, which I heard that day in Central Park.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">―trust her: those words he said at the very, very end.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That helped too, and our bond became even stronger than before.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But even so, today we had to say goodbye.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And it seemed that moment had finally come.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh! Looks like my train's here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車停止.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">In front of us, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s train came to a stop.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hup!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> got on the train without the slightest </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ちゅうちょ">hesitation</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "僕らの日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"See you! Let's meet again!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah! See you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>! I seriously love you!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s train slowly pulled away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車発進.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\手直し・追加\春花電車見送り.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
{DELETECG "新村春花画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, no matter what happens, I'll trust </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Whatever happens, I'll always be on your side.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and of course </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3"> too, are people who matter to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">My mom and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s mom must have made their mistakes precisely because they were best friends.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But as for me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, we'll be okay.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'm sure we'll be okay...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{DELETECG "五島絵梨奈画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">But I never heard from </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">No matter how many times I reached out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even after waiting a week.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even after waiting a month.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even after waiting a year...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―2 years later　Shiyo 802, April 8</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">With the third-year memorial service for </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> behind me, I was riding a train.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "五島絵梨奈画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Beside me was </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3">, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even after I moved, I'd met up with </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3"> every so often.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>... are you really going?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> looked anxious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Like I said, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, you don't have to force yourself to come. If you're turning back, now's your chance, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Unlike </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3">, I was leisurely enjoying the view from the train window.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I-I-I am going! If you're by yourself, <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, I'll worry! 
{PAUSE ""}
　It's with my support that you can give it your all, <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Heh heh, you're right. I'm not really pushing myself that hard, though. I'm just doing what I can."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Then all the more reason for the genius girl acknowledged by herself and everyone else, Erina Goto, to accompany you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> puffed out her chest, but it was obvious she was forcing the enthusiasm.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"This kind of reminds me of middle school. </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> helped me with so much. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Looking up all kinds of training routines for me, staying to practice with me until night..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I looked into all sorts of things this time too. About the Niimura family..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> had spent the past 2 years looking into the </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="あらた">Arata</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> settlement, where the Niimura main family is.</STYLE><PG>
"And you're still going. To that <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="あらた">Arata</STYLE> settlement..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Like I said, if you're scared, don't force yourself. This is something I'm doing on my own."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No! I'm definitely going! 
{PAUSE ""}
　Because, <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, you have a strong heart that can stand up to any hardship. It'll surely be fine!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh? Come to think of it... 
{PAUSE ""}
are you feeling all right? The cherry blossoms are in full bloom."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, ever since the incident 2 years ago, cherry blossoms don't bother me. Kind of simple of me, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Yes, my April sickness had abruptly gone into hiding from that time on.</STYLE><PG>
"Hmm. Then what about your knack for sensing danger?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, that's still there. Not all the time, but when I'm out in the wind, I can sense danger, at least."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... So the conditions that trigger <STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>'s intuition, which I've wondered about for ages, were 'cherry blossoms' and 'wind'..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> said that and gazed blankly outside.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>... there's something that keeps bothering me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> got a look from me, but </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3"> kept her eyes turned outside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Why did <STYLE ID="8">your mom</STYLE> keep staying at my house for a while, even after <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE> escaped from it, Senpai...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, wasn't it to kill the police, since they'd get in the way..."</STYLE><PG>
"I thought so too at first, but it's strange... 
{PAUSE ""}
If she'd wanted to, <STYLE ID="8">your mom</STYLE> should have been able to kill them all right away."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was true that </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> seemed to have been fighting back against the police officers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In fact, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was badly wounded then, and died.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, what do you think? If you're going that far, haven't you come to some conclusion?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"First, dodging bullets is obviously abnormal to begin with. Nobody could imagine something that absurd. 
{PAUSE ""}
If that was the trick behind the spiriting away..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Once something beyond common sense is involved, you have to think about everything beyond common sense. 
{PAUSE ""}
This is no longer an incident the police can handle. 
{PAUSE ""}
So if <STYLE ID="8">your mom's</STYLE> purpose, too, came from circumstances that weren't normal..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Circumstances that weren't normal...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Goto<STYLE ID="3"> lowered her eyes and hung her head.</STYLE><PG>
"This is a little hard to say... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Your mom's</STYLE> remains were returned already cremated, about 10 days after the incident, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I think it was about that long."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That seems a little unnatural to me. The injuries were obvious, and yet 10 days for an autopsy is far too long. 
{PAUSE ""}
And on top of that, she was even cremated... 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, in other words..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "0" "PASS"}
"Weren't <STYLE ID="8">your mom's</STYLE> remains switched?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm sorry, saying something weird. I have no basis at all... 
{PAUSE ""}
I heard <STYLE ID="6">your dad's</STYLE> remains were returned right away, so it feels a little off..."<PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">No, it's nothing... It's not like anything can be done about it now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I guess not..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"F-for now, let's think about </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay..."<PG>
Goto<STYLE ID="3">'s reasoning like this often hits the mark.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I began to think that heading to the Arata settlement like this might mean facing something big.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">No, let's not think about it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Right now, I'm going to bring </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> back.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">As for me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, we're best friends. Even now, my feelings haven't changed.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
