{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The train stopped at a station along the way, and the doors opened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A spring wind carrying the scent of cherry blossoms blew in.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE>, how is it? Do you sense any danger?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm not sure... I can't really tell..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I... see. 
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Then it'll surely be fine! Above all, I'm here with you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahaha! You're so reliable, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">. With </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">'s help, it'll surely be fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Surely..."</STYLE><PG>
